OL,3,ASeven arrested and police van set
OL,4,Aalight during Bonfire Night violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people were arrested and a police
OL,7,Fvan was set alight during Bonfire Night
OL,8,Fviolence in parts of Scotland.
OL,10,FA police officer and an ambulance staff
OL,11,Fmember also suffered minor injuries
OL,12,Fwhen they were attacked with fireworks
OL,13,Fwhile responding to a report of an
OL,14,Finjured man in Glasgow.
OL,16,FThe police vehicle was completely
OL,17,Fburned-out during the incident in
OL,18,FGreenside Street, in the Provanmill
OL,19,Farea of the city, and a 16-year-old boy
OL,20,Fwas arrested.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
